 "library": {
  "title": "Craftsman porch",
  "description": "Craftsman porch: an entrance porch for the front door of a house \u2014 Arts & Crafts style: tapered square columns on stone piers, a low gable. Overall about 4.5 x 2.7 x 4.0 m (width x depth x height). Stands on z = 0; place it against a facade with the door behind it. One of five porch styles (classical, craftsman, Victorian, rustic, modern) designed together.",
  "tags": [
